    icon used1 size 72 x 230 y 230 or ["automobile"] icon_look picture of car hidden true
    icon used2 size 72 x 370 y 230 or ["automobile"] icon_look picture of car hidden true
    icon used3 size 72 x 510 y 230 or ["automobile"] icon_look picture of car hidden true
    icon used4 size 72 x 650 y 230 or ["automobile"] icon_look picture of car hidden true
