      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:bh2rdz'
    '|a||How sure are we? That you must compare real with real is close to consensus.':
