      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1ez4ayd'
    '|b||Which side wins in a given case is contested, and it''s settled by evidence like Davis''s, not by slogans.':
